sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant MedusaAPI as Medusa API
    participant AuthMod as Auth Module
    participant EPService as EmailPassAuthService
    participant IdentitySvc as AuthIdentityService (DB)
    participant ScryptKDF as scrypt-kdf

    Note over Client,ScryptKDF: Registration
    Client->>MedusaAPI: POST /auth/customer/emailpass/register\n{ email, password }
    MedusaAPI->>AuthMod: register(actor_type, provider, body)
    AuthMod->>EPService: register(userData, authIdentityService)
    EPService->>EPService: validate email & password (strings)
    EPService->>IdentitySvc: retrieve({ entity_id: email })
    alt identity not found
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: MedusaError(NOT_FOUND)
        EPService->>ScryptKDF: kdf(password, hashConfig)
        ScryptKDF-->>EPService: hashBuffer
        EPService->>IdentitySvc: create({ entity_id: email, provider_metadata: { password: base64 } })
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: authIdentity
    else identity exists, app_metadata empty
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: authIdentity (unclaimed)
        EPService->>ScryptKDF: kdf(password, hashConfig)
        ScryptKDF-->>EPService: hashBuffer
        EPService->>IdentitySvc: update(email, { provider_metadata: { password: base64 } })
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: authIdentity
    else identity exists, app_metadata present
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: authIdentity (claimed)
        EPService-->>AuthMod: { success: false, error: "Identity already exists" }
        AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: 400 error
        MedusaAPI-->>Client: { message: "Identity already exists" }
    end
    EPService->>EPService: deep copy + delete provider_metadata.password
    EPService-->>AuthMod: { success: true, authIdentity }
    AuthMod->>AuthMod: sign JWT (actor_id, app_metadata)
    AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: { token }
    MedusaAPI-->>Client: { token }

    Note over Client,ScryptKDF: Authentication
    Client->>MedusaAPI: POST /auth/customer/emailpass\n{ email, password }
    MedusaAPI->>AuthMod: authenticate(actor_type, provider, body)
    AuthMod->>EPService: authenticate(userData, authIdentityService)
    EPService->>IdentitySvc: retrieve({ entity_id: email })
    alt not found
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: MedusaError(NOT_FOUND)
        EPService-->>AuthMod: { success: false, error: "Invalid email or password" }
    else found
        IdentitySvc-->>EPService: authIdentity
        EPService->>EPService: find ProviderIdentity for "emailpass"
        EPService->>EPService: Buffer.from(storedHash, "base64")
        EPService->>ScryptKDF: verify(hashBuffer, candidatePassword)
        alt verify returns true
            ScryptKDF-->>EPService: true
            EPService->>EPService: deep copy + delete password
            EPService-->>AuthMod: { success: true, authIdentity }
            AuthMod->>AuthMod: sign JWT
            AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: { token }
            MedusaAPI-->>Client: { token }
        else verify returns false
            ScryptKDF-->>EPService: false
            EPService-->>AuthMod: { success: false, error: "Invalid email or password" }
            AuthMod-->>MedusaAPI: 401
            MedusaAPI-->>Client: { message: "Invalid email or password" }
        end
    end
